[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Requirements:

  The tools read an Immich server over its API and the database of that
  same server directly.

Configuration:

1. Copy %%PREFIX%%/etc/immich-power-tools.env.sample to
   %%PREFIX%%/etc/immich-power-tools.env and fill it in. The DB_*
   settings are the ones www/immich keeps in %%PREFIX%%/etc/immich.env.
   The file is read as shell, so quote values holding spaces or any of
   $ ` " \ #.

2. sysrc immich_power_tools_enable=YES && service immich_power_tools start

Upstream listens on port 3000, which www/immich-public-proxy already
uses; this port starts on 127.0.0.1:3002 instead.
EOM
}
]
